<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>This is a reminder to report the KPIs for <strong><%= @kpi_report.for_name %></strong> for the period ending <strong><%= l @kpi_report.as_of %></strong>.</p>

<p>You can fill out the report by clicking the link below:</p>

<p class="btn btn-outline-primary"><%= link_to 'Fill KPI Report', edit_kpi_report_url(id: :shared, signed_id: KpiReport.signed_id_for_user(@kpi_report, @user), host: @entity.sub_domain + '.' + ENV.fetch('DOMAIN', 'localhost')) %></p>

<p>Thank you,<br>
<%= @entity.name %> Team</p>
